{"product":{"id":8144398352545,"title":"Bosch 74mm Throttle Body Hose \u0026 HD Clamp Adapters","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eWhen fitting OE Bosch DBW throttles, we quickly realize the limited real estate for attaching hoses and clamps. To solves this issue, we've created a series of billet adapters that slides over the Bosch DBW throttle body to allow the use of a standard hose coupler or HD clamp.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHD clamp compatibility is for Vibrant style HD clamps and similar.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFitment:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBosch 74mm Throttle Body (P#: \u003cspan\u003e0 280 750 474\u003c\/span\u003e)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBillet Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eO-rings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYellow Zinc Hardware\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNOTE:\u003c\/strong\u003e You MUST use a throttle with the listed part number above for proper fitment. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/4xHlM8BjdmQ?si=ylqL1LCFMoZWCfUV\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\" allowfullscreen=\"\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Outsider Garage","product_type":"DBW","created_at":"2024-10-02T19:18:44-04:00","handle":"bosch-74mm-throttle-body-hose-and-hd-clamp-adapters","updated_at":"2026-08-31T08:53:04-04:00","published_at":"2024-10-02T19:19:36-04:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"BFCM24, Bosch 74, DBW Accessories, Drive By Wire (DBW), Featured, Hose \u0026 HD Adapters","variants":[{"id":44651462590625,"product_id":8144398352545,"title":"3